          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in European manufacturing output increases the immediate availability of munitions, spare parts and dual-use components that can be allocated to shipments and contracts for Ukraine, raising the flow of external military materiel within weeks." />
