          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising financing costs push semiconductor and AI firms to seek unconventional funding (foreign partners, mergers, state aid), which triggers congressional inquiries and oversight into capital sources and technology transfer risks." />
