          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher market liquidity reduces transaction costs and eases trade‑finance and intermediation for large hardware deals, increasing the volume and speed of advanced chip cross‑border shipments; the reverse (liquidity drops) constrains flows." />
